        "_doc": "How the goods/military/trade/construction resource bonuses are applied. A resource on the tile counts in full, one within `radius` hexes at `nearbyWeight`; the summed fraction is capped at `cap`. Each scale turns that fraction into the effect: settlement goods output x(1+f*goods), recruit cost x(1-f*recruitCost), kingdom army regrowth x(1+f*armyRegen), settlement trade-route income x(1+f*routeIncome), player caravan profit x(1+f*caravanProfit), sale prices +f*salePrice, build cost x(1-f*buildCost), build time x(1-f*buildTime), settlement repairs x(1+f*repair).",
